  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5704.05 Release of Criminal History Record Check. Upon receipt of the information set forth in Saf-C 5704.04(a) above, the division shall complete the criminal history record check and submit the results to each named superintendent or chief executive officer.\n\nSource. #12606, eff 8-17-18",
